7	/**
8	 * Normalizes the telephone of a create request by stripping every non-digit character, then requires
9	 * exactly ten digits. The normalized value is written back onto the (republished) request so
10	 * {@link BuildOwner} stores and later responses return the digits-only form. A value that is not
11	 * exactly ten digits after stripping is rejected as a 400 via {@link InvalidTelephoneException}.
12	 */
